      <h3 class="course__title">AE203 Engineering Practice 1 - Manufacturing</h3>
      <p class="course__meta">Imperial College London, Department of Aeronautics</p>
      <p class="course__desc">This module introduces first-year aeronautics students to the principal manufacturing process families (casting, bulk and sheet forming, machining, joining, powder and additive processes, and composites), with an emphasis on digital, CNC, and algorithmic methods, taught through recurring aerospace case studies and supported by hands-on computational and workshop labs.</p>
