      <h3 class="course__title">Solid Mechanics</h3>
      <p class="course__meta">University of Houston, Department of Mechanical Engineering</p>
      <p class="course__desc">Fundamentals of continuum mechanics: tensorial representations of stress and strain states, constitutive behaviour, and the mechanics of one-dimensional structures: stretching, torsion, beam bending, and buckling.</p>
