    <div class="course__body">
      <h3 class="course__title">Computational Optimization of Structures and Materials</h3>
      <p class="course__meta">University of Houston, Department of Mechanical Engineering</p>
      <p class="course__desc">Formulation of design problems as optimization problems: objective functions and constraints, sensitivity analysis and gradient-based methods, and size, shape, and topology optimization of structures, with application to the inverse design of architected materials in a computational project.</p>
    </div>
